{"ticker":"PCG","updated":"2026-10-30T23:05:06Z","profile":{"longName":"PG&E Corporation","shortName":"Pacific Gas & Electric Co.","sector":"Utilities","industry":"Utilities - Regulated Electric","country":"United States","website":"https://www.pgecorp.com","fullTimeEmployees":29010,"marketCap":39571197952,"trailingPE":9.762963,"forwardPE":7.3148665,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":1.5352551,"pegRatio":0.55,"targetMeanPrice":17.55882,"targetHighPrice":24.0,"targetLowPrice":14.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":17,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":-0.01,"earningsGrowth":-0.089,"grossMargins":0.40574002,"operatingMargins":0.23642999,"profitMargins":0.11569,"totalRevenue":25774999552,"beta":0.279,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":19.16,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":11.77,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":1.51},"summary":"PG&E Corporation, through its subsidiary, Pacific Gas and Electric Company, engages in the sale and delivery of electricity and natural gas to customers in northern and central California, the United States. It generates electricity using nuclear, hydroelectric, fossil fuel-fired, fuel cells, and photovoltaic sources. The company owns and operates interconnected transmission lines; electric transmission substations, distribution lines, switching and distribution substations; and natural gas transmission, storage, and distribution systems consisting of distribution pipelines, backbone and local transmission pipelines, and various storage facilities. It serves residential, commercial, industrial, and agricultural customers, as well as natural gas-fired electric generation facilities. The company was incorporated in 1995 and is based in Oakland, California.","summary_zh":"PG&E Corporation 通过其子公司 Pacific Gas and Electric Company 向美国加利福尼亚州北部和中部的客户销售和输送电力和天然气。它利用核能、水力發電、化石燃料發電、燃料電池和光伏資源發電。该公司拥有并经营互连输电线路；输变电站、配电线路、开关和配电变电站；天然气输送、储存和分配系统，由分配管道、骨干和地方输送管道以及各种储存设施组成。它為住宅、商業、工業和農業客戶以及天然氣發電設施提供服務。該公司成立於 1995 年，總部位於加州奧克蘭。","sector_zh":"公用事業","industry_zh":"