:"分析師評等","count":3},{"name":"訂單/合約","count":2},{"name":"併購","count":2},{"name":"雲端/軟體","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-12","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1004980/000100498026000009/pcg-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"PG&E Corporation, incorporated in California in 1995, is a holding company whose primary operating subsidiary is Pacific Gas and Electric Company, a public utility operating in Northern and Central California. The Utility was incorporated in California in 1905. PG&E Corporation became the holding company of the Utility and its subsidiaries in 1997. The Utility generates revenues mainly through the sale and delivery of electricity and natural gas to customers. The Utility's service area is shown in the graphic below.","zh":"PG&E Corporation 於 1995 年在加州註冊成立，是一家控股公司，其主要營運子公司是太平洋天然氣電力公司 (Pacific Gas and Electric Company)，該公司是一家在加州北部和中部運營的公用事業公司。該公用事業公司於 1905 年在加州註冊成立。 PG&E 公司於 1997 年成為該公用事業公司及其子公司的控股公司。該公用事業公司主要透過向客戶銷售和交付電力和天然氣來產生收入。此實用程式的服務區域如下圖所示。"},{"en":"PG&E Corporation's and the Utility's operating revenues, income, and total assets for the most recently completed year can be found below in Item 8. Financial Statements and Supplementary Data.","zh":"PG&E 公司和公用事業公司最近一年的營業收入、收入和總資產可在下面第 8 項「財務報表和補充資料」中找到。"},{"en":"The principal executive offices of PG&E Corporation and the Utility are located at 300 Lakeside Drive, Oakland, California 94612. PG&E Corporation's telephone number is (415) 973-1000 and the Utility's telephone number is (415) 973-7000.","zh":"PG&E Corporation 和公用事業公司的主要執行辦公室位於 300 Lakeside Drive, Oakland, California 94612。 PG&E Corporation 的電話號碼為 (415) 973-1000，公用事業公司的電話號碼為 (415) 973-7000。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[{"en":"PG&E Corporation and the Utility are committed to building a safe, reliable, sustainable, and climate-resilient energy system at an affordable cost for customers. The Utility's capital investment plan, increasing procurement of renewable power and energy storage, increasing environmental regulations, and the cumulative impact of other public policy requirements collectively place continuing upward pressure on customer rates. Certain CPUC proceedings could impact different types of customers differently. The Utility has set a goal to increase customer capital investments while also limiting customer bill impacts, including by achieving operating cost savings, seeking efficient financing, and benefiting from electric load growth that reduces other customers' bills. The Utility plans to meet its cost savings goal through increased efficiencies including waste elimination through the Lean op","zh":"PG&E 公司和公用事業公司致力於以客戶可負擔的成本建立安全、可靠、可持續且具有氣候適應能力的能源系統。公用事業公司的資本投資計劃、增加再生能源和能源儲存的採購、不斷加強的環境法規以及其他公共政策要求的累積影響，共同對客戶費率造成了持續的上行壓力。某些 CPUC 程式可能會對不同類型的客戶產生不同的影響。該公用事業公司設定了一個目標，即增加客戶資本投資，同時限制客戶帳單影響，包括實現營運成本節約、尋求高效融資以及從減少其他客戶帳單的電力負載成長中受益。該公用事業公司計劃透過提高效率來實現其成本節約目標，包括透過精實營運消除浪費"}],"competition":[],"segments":{"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Electricity","val":18318000000,"zh":"電"},{"name":"Natural Gas Us Regulated","val":6617000000,"zh":"天然氣受美國監管"}],"total":24935000000}},"peers":["EIX","PEG","SRE","FE","AEP"]}}